WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.081
The Carters went horseback riding.

2
00:00:04.082 --> 00:00:08.189
"This is fun," Emmy said.

3
00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:11.607
"Yee-haw!" said Harry.

4
00:00:11.608 --> 00:00:16.398
"I'm a cowboy!"

5
00:00:16.399 --> 00:00:20.484
Harry's horse was named Buddy.

6
00:00:20.485 --> 00:00:24.283
"Go faster, Buddy!" Harry said

7
00:00:24.284 --> 00:00:27.045
The horse blinked.

8
00:00:27.046 --> 00:00:31.504
He did not go faster.

9
00:00:31.505 --> 00:00:36.024
"These horses are for new riders," said the guide.

10
00:00:36.025 --> 00:00:39.274
"They are slow and gentle.

11
00:00:39.275 --> 00:00:43.196
They are not supposed to gallop."

12
00:00:43.197 --> 00:00:47.169
"I'm a cowboy," Harry thought.

13
00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:51.879
"And cowboys' horses gallop!"

14
00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:55.355
Harry tapped the horse with his heels.

15
00:00:55.356 --> 00:00:58.459
Buddy moved faster.

16
00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:01.751
"That's better!" Harry said.

17
00:01:01.752 --> 00:01:06.810
But Buddy slowed down again.

18
00:01:06.811 --> 00:01:10.766
Oliver laughed.

19
00:01:10.767 --> 00:01:16.091
"Buddy knows you're not a real cowboy!"

20
00:01:16.092 --> 00:01:18.153
Harry frowned.

21
00:01:18.154 --> 00:01:22.533
"I'll show Buddy that I'm a real cowboy!"

22
00:01:22.534 --> 00:01:29.146
He shouted as loudly as he could. "Yee-haw!"

23
00:01:29.147 --> 00:01:31.359
Buddy jerked his head.

24
00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:35.208
He jumped in the air and then galloped!

25
00:01:35.209 --> 00:01:41.216
"Whoa!" Harry cried.

26
00:01:41.217 --> 00:01:43.764
Harry dropped the reins.

27
00:01:43.765 --> 00:01:49.462
He slipped sideways in the saddle.

28
00:01:49.463 --> 00:01:53.310
"Help!" Harry yelled.

29
00:01:53.311 --> 00:01:56.767
The guide raced after Buddy.

30
00:01:56.768 --> 00:02:01.079
He grabbed the reins.

31
00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:08.615
"Loud noises can scare horses," the guide said.

32
00:02:08.616 --> 00:02:11.033
Dad looked angry.

33
00:02:11.034 --> 00:02:13.700
"Follow the rules, Harry."

34
00:02:13.701 --> 00:02:16.917
"Sorry," Harry said.

35
00:02:16.918 --> 00:02:21.627
He took the reins.

36
00:02:21.628 --> 00:02:25.102
Then Harry patted Buddy.

37
00:02:25.103 --> 00:02:29.620
"I won't be a cowboy today," he said.

38
00:02:29.621 --> 00:02:41.512
"I'll just be Harry—very quietly."

